  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Girls Initiative for Resilient Learning and Support (GIRLS) Project aims to help women and girls to finish secondary school and to transition to Technical and Vocational Education and Training (TVET) or tertiary education in Malawi (2 districts), Rwanda (10 districts), and Zambia (4 districts).This programme is being delivered by Oxfam GB between July 2024 and March 2029, and&#xa0;is implemented through local organisations based in our partner countries.</narrative>
  </description>
